advanced-contract	Run Legacy live compatibility report and lineage floor	2026-10-05T12:39:36.1036864Z             "snippet": "The product is intentionally narrower than a general repository intelligence engine. Source-code search, LSPs, code graphs, test runners, static analyzers, web search, and coding agents remain complementary systems. DocAtlas supplies documentation/version evidence and provenance rather than claiming to replace those systems.",
