advanced-contract	Run Legacy live compatibility report and lineage floor	2026-10-05T12:39:36.1511155Z             "section": "Cleaning DocAtlas index state safely > Clear one project-local index",
advanced-contract	Run Legacy live compatibility report and lineage floor	2026-10-05T12:39:36.1511729Z             "snippet": "Review the preview, stop the Docs MCP\nserver and synchronization workers that use the same storage, then apply the\nsame plan:\n\n```bash\ndoc-atlas clear-index \\\n  --scope project-local \\\n  --project-path /absolute/path/to/project \\\n  --plan-digest <digest-from-preview> \\\n  --apply \\\n  --format json\n```",
