advanced-contract	Run Legacy live compatibility report and lineage floor	2026-10-05T12:39:36.1633034Z             "section": "Architecture > Per-library index isolation",
advanced-contract	Run Legacy live compatibility report and lineage floor	2026-10-05T12:39:36.1633831Z             "snippet": "## Per-library index isolation\n\nEach library+version has its own independent SQLite index. The `LibraryDocsService._index_config_for` method creates a separate database under `~/.docatlas/docs-indexes/<normalized_name>.db` and a separate extracted directory. This prevents cross-library contamination, enables independent refresh/recreate per target, and keeps the global `docatlas.db` registry lightweight (metadata only).",
advanced-contract	Run Legacy live compatibility report and lineage floor	2026-10-05T12:39:36.1633982Z             "version_binding": "unversioned",
